---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="SneakerNode 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/sneakernode.webp`} alt="SneakerNode" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">SneakerNode 评测</h1>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">7.0</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">住宅代理</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">1.15亿+ 住宅 IP · 2100万+ 移动 IP · 145+ 国家 · HTTP/SOCKS5</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">核心摘要</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">代理类型</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">住宅代理 + 移动代理</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">IP 规模</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">1.15 亿+ 住宅 IP / 2100 万+ 移动 IP</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">核心特性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">99.98% 成功率 · ~0.5s 响应 · 免费地理定位</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">覆盖范围</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">145+ 国家 · 700+ 运营商</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">品牌与平台概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          SneakerNode 是一家提供住宅和移动双类型代理的服务商，住宅代理池超 1.15 亿 IP，移动代理池超 2100 万 IP，覆盖 145+ 国家和 700+ 运营商。采用道德 IP 采集方式，99.98% 成功率，~0.5 秒响应时间。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          支持 HTTP/HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，提供免费的国家/州/城市/ASN 级定位。支持自动轮换和最长 30 分钟粘性会话。按量计费，无隐藏费用。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">产品类型</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">住宅 + 移动</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">住宅代理 · 1.15亿+ IP · 19+ 国家</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">移动代理 · 2100万+ IP · 145+ 国家 · 700+ 运营商</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">旋转+粘性 · 按量计费</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">免费地理定位</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">99.98% 在线率</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">24/7 支持</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">平台特性</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">超大 IP 规模</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">1.15 亿+ 住宅 IP + 2100 万+ 移动 IP，覆盖 145+ 国家 700+ 运营商，资源丰富。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">极速响应</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">~0.5 秒平均响应时间，99.98% 采集成功率，适合实时数据抓取和高频请求场景。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">免费精准定位</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">国家/州/城市/坐标/ASN 五级定位，无需额外费用，精准控制出口 IP 地理位置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">灵活会话控制</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持自动轮换和最长 30 分钟粘性会话，适应不同任务对 IP 稳定性的需求。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>住宅+移动双类型，IP 规模庞大</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>99.98% 成功率 + 0.5s 超快响应</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>免费五级地理定位</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>按量计费，无隐藏费用</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>住宅仅 19+ 国家，不如移动覆盖广</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>价格不够透明</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌较新，用户评价少</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          SneakerNode 以庞大的住宅+移动双 IP 池和极速响应为特色，免费五级地理定位和灵活会话控制增强了可用性。99.98% 成功率使其在数据采集场景中表现可靠。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          不足在于住宅覆盖国家较少、价格透明度和品牌知名度有待提升。综合评估，SneakerNode 获得 7.0 分评价。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://sneakernode.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 SneakerNode
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
